# The project fingerprint (lobster-fingerprint/v1) hashes file BYTES. Any end-of-line
# conversion on checkout would change those bytes and invalidate a valid receipt on the
# other platform, so this repository stores and checks out every file verbatim.
* -text

# Belt and braces for the trees a receipt hashes directly.
golden/** -text
schemas/** -text
scripts/** -text
*.png binary
*.json -text
